&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/strong&gt; – Generous paid leave to support families through birth or adoption: Up to 12 weeks for parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Remote-First Team&lt;/strong&gt; – Work from anywhere in the U.S.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unlimited PTO &amp;amp; 10 Holidays&lt;/strong&gt; – So you can relax and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
